a class="on-page-sub-nav__link" href="/eczema-products/?product_category=3276">Hair Product</a></li><li><a class="on-page-sub-nav__link" href="/eczema-products/?product_category=3304">Laundry</a></li><li><a class="on-page-sub-nav__link" href="/eczema-products/?product_category=3231">Moisturizer</a></li><li><a class="on-page-sub-nav__link" href="/eczema-products/?product_category=3236">Over the counter drugs</a></li><li><a class="on-page-sub-nav__link" href="/eczema-products/?product_category=3259">Sunscreen</a></li></ul></nav></section><div class="bread-crumb"><div class="container"><nav class="bread-crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol class="bread-crumbs__list-wrapper"><li><div class="block"><a class="link link--icon__normal" target="_self" href="/">Home</a></div></li><li><svg class="svg-icon-breadcrumb" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 6 10"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="m1 9 4-4-4-4"></path></svg><a class="link link--icon__normal" target="_self" href="/eczema-products/"><span>Products</span></a></li><li class="active"><svg class="svg-icon-breadcrumb" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 6 10"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="m1 9 4-4-4-4"></path></svg><span>Super Saturated</span></li></ol></nav></div></div><section class="product-hero"><div class="arc-container"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" height="120" viewBox="0 0 1440 120" fill="none" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M-1.00002 119.113H1439.52C1214.25 42.2986 971.815 0.5 719.26 0.5C466.705 0.5 224.274 42.2986 -1.00002 119.113Z" fill="#CDEAF4"></path></svg></div><div class="product-hero__container"><div class="container"><div class="product-hero__wrapper"><div class="product-hero__product-item"><div class="product-hero__product-image-block"><div class="marker-tag marker-tag--new"><div class="marker-tag__text marker-tag__text--theme-air"><span class="marker-tag__visual-text" aria-hidden="false">New Product</span></div></div><img alt="Super Saturated Image" fetchPriority="high" loading="lazy" width="400" height="477" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcms.nationaleczema.org%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F07%2FSuper-Saturated-Product-Hero-Image.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcms.nationaleczema.org%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F07%2FSuper-Saturated-Product-Hero-Image.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcms.nationaleczema.org%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F07%2FSuper-Saturated-Product-Hero-Image.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75"/></div></div><div class="product-hero__product-detail-block"><div class="product-hero__detailed-description"><p class="brand-name">Experiment Beauty</p><h2>Super Saturated</h2><p>At higher percentages glycerin goes beyond hydration to unlock its unique barrier replenishing and soothing properties. This one-of-a-kind saturating blue goo also has multi-molecular weight humectants like polyglutamic acid, and super soothers like bisabolol, prickly pear extract, and niacinamide to keep irritation at bay. Super Saturated is clinically proven to increase skin&#x27;s resilience and natural hydration overtime. 

As your main serum: On clean, damp skin, apply 1-2 pumps. Follow with your favorite moisturizer or oil to lock in the hydration. You can use Super Saturated AM &amp; PM

As a humectant booster: Add humectant goodness with 1 pump of Super Saturated in your favorite hydrating serums for boosted barrier support and hydration</p></div><div class="product-hero__product-cta"><a target="_blank" class="button button--icon button--small button--icon__light" href="https://experimentbeauty.com/products/super-saturated"><span class="icon-text">Visit Product Website</span></a><a target="_blank" class="button button--icon button--small button--icon__light" href="https://www.google.com/search?q=Super%20Saturated"><span class="icon-text">Search on Google</span></a></div><section class="accordion-section"><div class="container"><div class="accordion"><div class="accordion__wrapper"><div class="accordion--item"><button class="accordion--item__head" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-panel-0" id="accordion-header-0" type="button"><span class="accordion--item__head--text">Ingredients</span><svg class="ml-8 mt-2 shrink-0 fill-navy" width="16" height="16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect y="7" width="16" height="2" rx="1" class="origin-center transform transition duration-200 ease-out false"></rect><rect y="7" width="16" height="2" rx="1" class="origin-center rotate-90 transform transition duration-200 ease-out false"></rect></svg></button><div class="accordion--item__content " id="accordion-panel-0" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-header-0" aria-hidden="true"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="rich-text-content"><p>Allantoin, Bisabolol, Diglycerin, Disodium Edta, Ethylparaben, Glycerin, Malachite Extract, Methylparaben, Niacinamide, Opuntia Ficus-Indica Stem Extract, Phenoxyethanol, Polyacrylate Crosspolymer-6, Polyglutamic Acid, Propanediol, Propylene Glycol, Sodium Polyacrylate, Squalane, Tocopherol, Water, Zingiber Officinale (Ginger) Root Extract</p></div></div></div></div><div class="accordion--item"><button class="accordion--item__head" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-panel-1" id="accordion-header-1" type="button"><span class="accordion--item__head--text">About the Seal</span><svg class="ml-8 mt-2 shrink-0 fill-navy" width="16" height="16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect y="7" width="16" height="2" rx="1" class="origin-center transform transition duration-200 ease-out false"></rect><rect y="7" width="16" height="2" rx="1" class="origin-center rotate-90 transform transition duration-200 ease-out false"></rect></svg></button><div class="accordion--item__content " id="accordion-panel-1" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-header-1" aria-hidden="true"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="rich-text-content"><p>Individuals with eczema and/or sensitive skin have the responsibility for identifying ingredients in any product that could potentially irritate their skin and/or trigger potential allergies. Healthcare related questions should be referred to a physician or other healthcare provider, including questions regarding product ingredients, as well as whether use of the accepted product(s) is suitable. See the Seal of Acceptance™ product directory for additional program information.</p>
</div></div></div></div><div class="accordion--item"><button class="accordion--item__head" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-panel-2" id="accordion-header-2" type="button"><span class="accordion--item__head--text">Disclaimer</span><svg class="ml-8 mt-2 shrink-0 fill-navy" width="16" height="16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect y="7" width="16" height="2" rx="1" class="origin-center transform transition duration-200 ease-out false"></rect><rect y="7" width="16" height="2" rx="1" class="origin-center rotate-90 transform transition duration-200 ease-out false"></rect></svg></button><div class="accordion--item__content " id="accordion-panel-2" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-header-2" aria-hidden="true"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="rich-text-content"><p>The directory contains a listing of products which have received the Seal of Acceptance™. <a href="https://nationaleczema.org/eczema-products/seal-home">Learn more about the Seal.</a></p>
</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></div></div></div></div></section><div class="ads-block gpt-ad-original  "><!-- /22697575788/nea/body1 -->
<div id='div-gpt-ad-body1' style='min-width: 300px; min-height: 90px;'>
  
